+### Bot Webhooks (`User::Bot::Webhook` & `Bots::WebhookDeliveryJob`)
+
+- **Triggering**: On `Message` `after_create_commit`, `Room#receive(message)` enqueues `Bots::WebhookDeliveryJob` on the `default` queue (one job per mentioned active bot with a `webhook_url` in that room) so slow or failing webhooks never slow down message creation or block other bots. Bot-authored messages never trigger webhooks (`Message::Mentionee#mentioned_bots`), preventing echo/bot-to-bot loops.
